{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "12cef5e9-e86c-8f76-a9f9-7f819e48811a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T13:55:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth, happy Tuesday. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. My name is Ana Cabral. I signed up for a class through you, a pottery class, and it got cancelled. I'd like a refund, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry about that. Do you know which session it was, or when it was supposed to start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was the Thursday evening one, supposed to start this week. I got the email yesterday that it was cancelled, um, não tinha inscrições suficientes, sorry, not enough people signed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to apologize, that happens. Did you register online or in person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online. I paid when I registered, so I want that money back on the same card."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's usually how it goes. Let me pull up your name. Cabral, C-A-B-R-A-L?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Ana, just one N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:53:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I see the registration and I see it's marked cancelled. I'll put the refund through to the original card. It can take a little while to show up on your statement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. How long is a little while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually several business days, sometimes a bit more depending on your bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Another thing. Is there an age limit for your classes? I was looking at the other ones, the adult ones."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the class. Adult classes are generally for sixteen and up, and the kids' programs are listed by age range. Which one were you thinking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe the painting class for adults. It's for me. I'm repainting a dollhouse for my granddaughter, so, a casa de bonecas, sorry, the dollhouse, and I want to learn to do it better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's sweet. Then the adult painting class would be perfect, and there's no upper age limit on those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll look at the schedule online then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:54:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Do you want me to email you a confirmation of the refund?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, to the same email as the registration. And if you need to reach me, it's 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:55:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I have that. You'll get the email today. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T13:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ana. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
